      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPER STRIDE (4) is in top form, scoring by 1.75 lengths (22.43) over 400m at this track and making it back to back wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Looks the one to beat. OCCULENT (1) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive three back in his flying 22.78 win at The Gardens over 400m. Top win three back and rates a key player again. RED HOT TINA (7) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish a nose back in second (22.50) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. BACKYARD FRIENDS (3) returns here with a good chance to improve on last time.",
